e Spice Girls cassette but  accidentally press the record button  instead oh my gosh our music was gone  forever at least we had our yellow  Walkmans following us everywhere some of  them were even waterproof as if swimming  in a pool wasn't already fun enough huh  but then we grew up and discovered new  technologies the first iPod was not  there yet but we enjoyed the hit clips  music players each cartridge could only  play one song but we were so popular  when we owned one if only we could still  appreciate the value of music like we  did before and that's it for 10 pictures  that will make you feel oh  if you were a 90s kid don't be shy to  tell us about your best memories from  your childhood make sure to give us a  big thumbs up if you owned any of the  objects and don't forget to subscribe to  the things for more videos like this  thanks for watching and bye bye  [Music]

